Chapter: WeaponData

 Modified UOX3 weapon data and CHandleCombat weapon classes, GPL-2.0-or-later.
 Copyright 1997, 98 Marcus Rating (Cironian); see the retained UOX3 license. License: ports/UOX3-LICENSE.txt.
 Generated by import-weapons.ps1 from UOX3 data/dfndata/items/gear/weapons/weapons_t2a (damage, spd, str) and
 source/combat.cpp GetWeaponType and GetCombatSkill. A weapon answers low + 256 * high + 65536 * speed
 + 16777216 * strength + 4294967296 * skill; 0 is a graphic that is not a weapon.
